body:json {
  {
    "query": "opay",
    "accountNumber": "0123456789"
  }
}

docs {
  # Suggest Transfer Banks
  
  Use this endpoint while the user is typing a bank name or after entering a 10 digit account number.
  
  It only returns curated popular Nigerian banks. Name aliases are supported, so `opay`, `o pay`, or `paycom` all rank OPay first; `gtb` ranks GTBank first; and `monie point` ranks Moniepoint first.
  
  ## Endpoint
  
  `POST /api/v1/wallet/transfers/suggest-banks`
  
  ## Authentication
  
  Required.
  
  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```
  
  ## Request Body
  
  ```json
  {
    "query": "opay"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Success Response
  
  ```json
  {
    "accountNumber": null,
    "query": "opay",
    "suggestions": [
      {
        "name": "OPay",
        "slug": "opay",
        "bankCode": "760",
        "mapleradBankCode": "760",
        "availableForTransfer": true,
        "resolverProvider": "maplerad",
        "transferProvider": "maplerad",
        "confidence": "exact_name"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "method": "popular_name",
      "accountNameResolved": false,
      "checkedBanks": 19,
      "popularBanksOnly": true
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Frontend Behavior
  
  - while the user types a bank name, send it as `query`
  - if the user types `opay`, automatically show OPay first
  - after the user enters 10 account digits, optionally send both `query` and `accountNumber`
  - if `suggestions` has items, show them as bank suggestions
  - if `suggestions` is empty, show nothing and let user select bank manually
  - after user selects a bank, call `Resolve Transfer Account` to fetch account name
  
  ## Important
  
  This endpoint deliberately suggests only popular banks. The complete Maplerad bank list remains available from `GET /api/v1/wallet/transfers/banks`.
}
